 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-TYPE L-WIDTH L-HEIGHT L-TICKER L-SLOTS.
     MOVE 0 TO L-WIDTH L-HEIGHT L-TICKER L-SLOTS
     EVALUATE L-TYPE
