 PROGRAM-ID. BE3-SIGN-COLORS.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-NAME                PIC X(32).
 01 WS-LEN                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DIFFUSE             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FIREWORK            BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-RGB                 BINARY-LONG.
